{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25838","headline":"苏州不住遥望武丘报恩两寺 · 李绅","name":"苏州不住遥望武丘报恩两寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"秋山古寺东西远，竹院松门怅望同。\n幽鸟静时侵径月，野烟消处满林风。\n塔分朱雁余霞外，刹对金螭落照中。\n官备散寮身却累，往来慙谢二莲宫。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李绅","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25838.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25838","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}